          "extraction_version": "public-extract-v1",
          "chunks": [
            "His biography is available in 21 different languages on Wikipedia. Lee Zii Jia is the 81st most popular badminton player (down from 43rd in 2024), the 84th most popular biography from Malaysia (down from 71st in 2019) and the 5th most popular Malaysian Badminton Player.",
