            "Among badminton players, Lee Zii Jia ranks 81 out of 285. Before him are Tine Baun, Nova Widianto, Li Xuerui, Ge Fei, Ayaka Takahashi, and Lee Kyung-won. After him are Flandy Limpele, Nina Vislova, Maria Kristin Yulianti, Carsten Mogensen, Larisa Griga, and Pablo Abi\u00e1n.",
            "Among people born in 1998, Lee Zii Jia ranks 317. Before him are Patrik Laine, Amber Frank, Markelle Fultz, Chermen Valiev, Manu Garc\u00eda, and Nathan Gamble. After him are Clairo, Jordan Lotomba, Michael Folorunsho, Fyodor Chalov, Pedrinho, and M\u00ebrgim Berisha.",
            "Among people born in Malaysia, Lee Zii Jia ranks 84 out of 129. Before him are Nicholas Teo (1981), Julian Leow Beng Kim (1964), Shila Amzah (1990), Alex Edmondson (1993), Yeo Yann Yann (1977), and Yuna (1986). After him are Shauna Macdonald (1981), Fairuz Fauzy (1982), Moyuka Uchijima (2001), Nicol David (1983), Safee Sali (1984), and Pandelela Rinong (1993).",
            "Among badminton players born in Malaysia, Lee Zii Jia ranks 5. Before him are Lee Chong Wei (1982), Rashid Sidek (1968), Razif Sidek (1962), and Jalani Sidek (1964). After him are Yap Kim Hock (1970), Goh Liu Ying (1989), Soh Wooi Yik (1998), Goh V Shem (1989), Chan Peng Soon (1988), Aaron Chia (1997), and Tan Wee Kiong (1989).",
